### Feature Vaccine — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 3
@token = 
# @name updateVaccinePut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/vacunas/{{id}}
